        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn-ST1BI, Heart Shaped Smooth Iron Handle Set</b>\r\n<p>\r\nRustic style front door handle set with heart shaped ends. This set includes the deadbolt for a complete and matching kit.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Smooth Iron</b> surface hardware is typical of early American styling, with a flat black appearance which simulates the hardware as it was originally forged.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</B> of Heart Style Deadbolt Handle set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Handleset height: 11-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Handleset width: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>For 1-3/4\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Fits pre-drilled doors - 2-3/8\" crossbores, 15/16\" edgebores only </li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass Deadlock Cylinder with 1\" throw, Type C keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Reversible, Non-handed, for Right or Left hand doors.</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Smooth Black Iron</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>*This Item is Discontinued.</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
